    <h2>Page hero and breadcrumbs</h2>
    <p class="sg-intro">Every inner page opens with <code>.page-hero</code> (it ends in a hairline with a hatched strip). Use <code>&lt;header class="page-hero"&gt;</code> inside <code>main</code>. <code>.page-hero--split</code> adds an aside column for a drawing or photo.</p>
